18
00:01:24,328 --> 00:01:29,895
The service layer verifies payload constraints and email uniqueness, then

19
00:01:30,045 --> 00:01:36,168
hashes the password using BCrypt with a workload factor of 10.

20
00:01:36,318 --> 00:01:41,885
The account is created with verification locked, preventing unauthorized login.

21
00:01:42,035 --> 00:01:45,376
A 24-hour verification token is issued.

22
00:01:45,526 --> 00:01:50,536
In this portfolio demo mode, the token is provided

23
00:01:50,686 --> 00:01:56,253
